	(text "RIPPLE-CARRY FULL ADDERS, bit 0 to bit 3: P = A xor XB, S = P xor Cin, Cout = A.XB + P.Cin.  G = NAND(A, XB) is also NOT (A and XB), P is A xor XB, and A or XB = NAND(NOT P, G): the logic functions fall out of the adder"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
